# Third-party licenses

BrainBend Studio is built with the open-source software below. Each is used under the license shown, and its
license text and copyright notices follow. BrainBend Studio's own license is in LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE.
The fonts bundled with the app and the spelling word list have their own notices in the app's About page and
`assets/fonts/`.

ffmpeg is not part of the app. When you use a video feature, Studio asks, then downloads it once and runs it as a
separate program. It is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3. Its license text, build details
and a source offer are kept with it in `~/.brainbend-studio/components/` and at
https://github.com/brainbend/studio-components.

